WEBVTT

00:26:28.432 --> 00:26:31.936
and you're going to ruin it
if you keep talking like this."

00:26:31.960 --> 00:26:35.036
AG: For a while,
Carmen did censor herself.

00:26:35.060 --> 00:26:37.986
She suppressed the part of her
that was a heretic.

00:26:38.010 --> 00:26:41.016
She created what's called
a "facade of conformity."

00:26:41.040 --> 00:26:42.405
She put on a mask

00:26:42.429 --> 00:26:45.106
and pretended to align
with the CIA's values.

00:26:45.130 --> 00:26:48.583
Research shows that's a great way
to burn yourself out.

00:26:48.607 --> 00:26:53.156
And finally, after nearly two years,
the mask slipped.

00:26:53.180 --> 00:26:55.766
CM: "I'm just sick and tired of this!

00:26:55.790 --> 00:26:58.856
All you care about is getting promoted

00:26:58.880 --> 00:27:01.284
and getting ahead in the organization.